# ❄️ IceStream

## Real-Time Lakehouse Observability

IceStream is a real-time data observability system that monitors
streaming data, detects data-quality problems, isolates bad records,
and provides visibility into the health of the data pipeline.

---

# 🎯 Project Goal

The goal of IceStream is to build a real-time system that can:

- Generate continuous transaction data
- Stream data through Apache Kafka
- Process data using Apache Flink
- Detect data-quality problems
- Isolate bad records using a DLQ
- Store reliable data using Apache Iceberg
- Detect schema drift
- Monitor error rates
- Trigger a circuit breaker when data quality becomes unsafe
- Display pipeline health through a dashboard

---

